{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-7","kind":"proposition","title":"两三角形的第一角等而第二相当角各两旁之边比例等其第三相当角或俱小于直角或俱…","englishTitle":"If two triangles have one angle equal to one angle, the sides about other angles proportional, and the remaining angles either both less or both not less than a right angle, the triangles will be equiangular and will have those angles equal, the sides about which are proportional.","book":6,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.7/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","contentId":"euclid-6-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75e6480ae2f3c2d85bac2a3a65daa6f62b7e87c844db30f282b65605a0b82694","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-7.statement","euclid-6-7.construction.1","euclid-6-7.proof.1","euclid-6-7.construction.2","euclid-6-7.proof.2","euclid-6-7.proof.3","euclid-6-7.proof.4","euclid-6-7.proof.5","euclid-6-7.proof.6","euclid-6-7.proof.7","euclid-6-7.proof.8","euclid-6-7.proof.9","euclid-6-7.proof.10","euclid-6-7.proof.11","euclid-6-7.proof.12","euclid-6-7.proof.13","euclid-6-7.proof.14","euclid-6-7.proof.15","euclid-6-7.proof.16","euclid-6-7.proof.17","euclid-6-7.proof.18","euclid-6-7.conclusion","euclid-6-7.historical.1","euclid-6-7.historical.2","euclid-6-7.historical.3","euclid-6-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b2ac4a3e233ff01380ae6d2a258f0541270529719e4677d1535e7d92604b3e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have one angle equal to one angle, the sides about other angles proportional, and the remaining angles either both less or both not less than a right angle, the triangles will be equiangular and will have those angles equal, the sides about which are proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形有一个角度等于一个角度,则其他角度的两边为成比例,其余角度小于或不小于直角,则三角形为等角,其边为成比例。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形之第一角等而第二相当角各两旁之边比例等其第三相当角或俱小于直角或俱不小于直角即两形为等角形而对各相似边之角各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的第一个角相等，第二个等角对应边的比例相等；第三个等角要么小于直角，要么不小于直角。在这种情况下，这两种形状是等边三角形，并且每条相似边上的角相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7fb750293727f7fc8aa1e2d9ab9e11c3abfb3cc1137e40889a42f8152c159b0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having one angle equal to one angle, the angle BAC to the angle EDF, the sides about other angles ABC, DEF proportional, so that, as AB is to BC, so is DE to EF, and, first, each of the remaining angles at C, F less than a right angle; I say that the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF, the angle ABC will be equal to the angle DEF, and the remaining angle, namely the angle at C, equal to the remaining angle, the angle at F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF三角形成为两个三角形,一个角度等于一个角度,BAC角度等于EDF角度,其他角度的两边为ABC、DEF、成比例,成比例,这样,AB至BC的比等于DE至EF的比,首先,其余角的每个角度为C、F比直角的比都小;我说三角形ABC是方形DEF,角ABC等于角DEF,其余角,即角C,角F；AB 与 BC 之比等于 DE 与 EF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccec8288f60c216ad6fe84da9f6b822d273ca6f627e9044e518c0d1a7ab33265","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the angle ABC is unequal to the angle DEF, one of them is greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果ABC角度与DEF角度不相等,其中之一是更大的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9203c3b153c152ab0b4ec76650f2b13f6e9f79a1e1bc111ada953d12c75f4a28","citations":["euclid-1-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle ABC be greater; and on the straight line AB, and at the point B on it, let the angle ABG be constructed equal to the angle DEF. [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC角更大一点;在AB线上,在B点,让ABG角等于DEF角。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f0585426e93de88f27639ef8ccd366d7b403230bfe77094e4c05ad4525441ee","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angle A is equal to D, and the angle ABG to the angle DEF, therefore the remaining angle AGB is equal to the remaining angle DFE. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A角等于D,ABG角等于DEF角,因此其余的AGB角等于其余的DFE角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a95335c2d8824c4a1485ebb0c182c89784f1c02e0667fad8c95630330aca3fd5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABG is equiangular with the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABG是同三角形DEF的等角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d94f0dfbc53acf573fc0cd821258adac1dcfdbd4704dddfd89470dca0886410","citations":["euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as AB is to BG, so is DE to EF [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB对BG的比等于DE对EF的比；AB 与 BG 之比等于 DE 与 EF 之比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0382aa34ae1c23a659f0668440b4b9005faa4d2e5a1f920a739bb1b2d30f5182","citations":["euclid-5-11","euclid-5-9","euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as DE is to EF, so by hypothesis is AB to BC; therefore AB has the same ratio to each of the straight lines BC, BG; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore BC is equal to BG, [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)] so that the angle at C is also equal to the angle BGC. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,由于DE比EF,因此假设是AB比BC;因此,AB与BG直线的每条比例相同;因此,BC等于BG,C角也等于BGC角。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)] [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a4e4714188c66d4057d31a2b311c2fd8d098ce21bb234f8a53770fa39df1eb0","citations":["euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, the angle at C is less than a right angle; therefore the angle BGC is also less than a right angle; so that the angle AGB adjacent to it is greater than a right angle. [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设C时的角小于直角;因此,BGC时的角小于直角;因此,相邻的角AGB大于直角。 [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9994324aa158350f8849f725998d61184bf8056d80f71bd61901de0bcdc1918a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was proved equal to the angle at F; therefore the angle at F is also greater than a right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"事实证明它等于F时的角, 因此F时的角也大于直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22c925215c6118e00d1c9d6842ee386a181fcef7705b112da26913f1b58c7d79","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is by hypothesis less than a right angle : which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但假设不到直角:这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3aa917832f0be6431678eba6d17bb7512d9ab0280a70832e61526745fac550ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle ABC is not unequal to the angle DEF; therefore it is equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC角度与DEF角度不相等;因此,它等于DEF角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"beb8608850f142a0e7bfb1607cdf93f963434c9b6d76d6e87baf1dfe9e642525","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle at A is also equal to the angle at D; therefore the remaining angle at C is equal to the remaining angle at F. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A时的角也等于D时的角;因此,C时的剩余角等于F时的剩余角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d683dcdc7aa37b1598c3cb7768de588fa8d459b1b1cf541b3223acc796763b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABC是同三角形DEF的等角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5fd55e7a567aa2fbe9d04a337008432d01270b3031019fadfb017c4059359b23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, again, let each of the angles at C, F be supposed not less than a right angle; I say again that, in this case too, the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,让C,F的每一个角度不少于直角;我再说一遍,在这种情况下,ABC三角形与DEF三角形是等角形的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16daacc98d63cdf87c61d3b3d54cf38bb3220086ad474ff5fc8173977b3ad341","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, we can prove similarly that BC is equal to BG; so that the angle at C is also equal to the angle BGC. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,通过同样的构造,我们可以证明,BC等于BG;这样,C的角也等于BGC。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0efe9d8ae89f7ba0aac05f55d307199b22e4761e618bb0a98a9429c07e5c658","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle at C is not less than a right angle; therefore neither is the angle BGC less than a right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但C角不小于直角,因此,BGC角也小于直角角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d7851f3c936858c85ad0caea3bd0c0ab47c3f55e60014215b5b41ad9a314d53","citations":["euclid-1-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus in the triangle BGC the two angles are not less than two right angles: which is impossible. [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在三角形BGC中,两个角度不少于两个直角:这是不可能的。 [[I. 17](/principles/euclid-1-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c03a87ec7505267b38fa42aec9786e8fa7954cc005482e8f67013315bce66dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, once more, the angle ABC is not unequal to the angle DEF; therefore it is equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC角度与DEF角度的差别再次出现,因此与ABC角度的差别是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"beb8608850f142a0e7bfb1607cdf93f963434c9b6d76d6e87baf1dfe9e642525","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle at A is also equal to the angle at D; therefore the remaining angle at C is equal to the remaining angle at F. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A时的角也等于D时的角;因此,C时的剩余角等于F时的剩余角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d683dcdc7aa37b1598c3cb7768de588fa8d459b1b1cf541b3223acc796763b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABC是同三角形DEF的等角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":22,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"955d6fff8f7acfd638640bb1b1e6edad865b9499937b2c9e248b7fcad48419ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形之第一角等而第二相当角各两旁之边比例等其第三相当角或俱小于直角或俱不小于直角即两形为等角形而对各相似边之角各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的第一个角相等，第二个等角对应边的比例相等；第三个等角要么小于直角，要么不小于直角。在这种情况下，这两种形状是等边三角形，并且每条相似边上的角相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":23,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82d1fd200be2b8ad36e677c04a2e977584c0379395a2518e4dd657ec2e422576","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁戊己两角形其一甲角与一丁角等而第二相当角如甲丙乙两旁之甲丙丙乙两边偕丁己戊两旁之丁己己戊两边比例等其第三相当角如乙与戊或俱小于直角或俱不小于直角题言两形等角者谓甲丙乙角与己等乙角与戊等先论乙与戊俱小于直角者曰如云不然而甲丙乙大于己令作甲丙庚角与己等即甲庚丙角宜与戊等〈一卷卅二〉甲庚丙与丁戊己为等角形矣即甲丙与丙庚之比例宜若丁己与己戊〈本篇四〉而先设甲丙与丙乙若丁己与己戊也是甲丙与丙庚亦若甲丙与丙乙也〈五卷十一〉是庚丙与乙丙两线等也〈五卷九〉丙庚乙与丙乙庚两角亦等也〈一卷五〉夫乙既小于直角即等腰内之丙庚乙亦小于直角则较角之丙庚甲必大于直角也〈丙庚甲丙庚乙两角等于两直角见一卷十三〉而丙庚甲既与戊等则丙庚乙宜大于直角矣其相等之乙角何由得小于直角也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁戊己：两个三角形：一个 甲 等于 丁，第二个是等角，例如在 甲丙乙 两侧的 甲丙丙乙 和在 丁己戊 两侧的 丁己己戊。第三个等角，例如 乙 和 戊，要么小于直角，要么不小于直角。命题：两个等角的解释意味着 甲丙乙 和 己 是相等的角，乙 和 戊 都小于直角。首先，如果 乙 和 戊 都小于直角，则称 甲丙 和 戊 都小于直角。如果 甲丙乙 大于 己，则 甲丙庚 和 己 应为等边三角形 〈一卷卅二〉甲庚丙 甲庚丙 和 丁戊己 应为等边三角形。因此，甲庚丙 应等于 戊 和 丁戊己 作为等边三角形。因此，甲庚丙 和 甲庚丙 应为等边三角形 丁戊己。因此，乙 和 戊 都是等边三角形。因此，甲丙乙 大于 己。让我们使 甲丙庚 等于 己，这意味着 甲庚丙 应该等于 戊 和 丁戊己 应为等边三角形。因此，甲庚丙 应等于 戊 和 丁戊己 作为等边三角形。因此，乙 和 戊 都是等边三角形 丁戊己 等于 戊。因此，甲庚丙 和 丁戊己 是等边三角形。因此，甲丙乙 大于 己，并且 甲丙庚 应视为与 戊 相等的三角形，意味着 甲庚丙 和 丁戊己 是等边三角形。因此，甲庚丙5 应等于 戊 和 丁戊己 作为等边三角形。因此 丁戊己 和 丁戊己 是等边三角形。因此，即 甲丙 与 丙庚 的比例应像 丁己 和 己戊〈本篇四〉，首先设置 甲丙 和 丙乙。如果 丁己 和 己戊 也是 甲丙 和 丙庚，则 甲丙 和 丙庚 应该像 甲丙 和 丙乙。〈五卷十一〉 意味着两条直线 庚丙 和 乙丙 相等 〈五卷九〉丙庚乙 和 丙乙庚 的两个角也相等。〈一卷五〉。由于 乙 小于直角，即二等边内的 丙庚乙 也小于直角，因此 丙庚甲 必须大于直角。〈丙庚甲丙庚乙两角等于两直角见一卷十三〉 和 丙庚甲 等于 戊，因此 丙庚乙 应大于直角。乙 的等角如何小于直角？"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":24,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c2b7ae4c9341fcbc78daa9f8f52c9b1414c3aca7d13125ad54fd1bd28a9d685","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后论：乙与戊俱不小于直角者曰如云不然依先论乙角与丙庚乙角等即丙庚乙亦不小于直角夫丙庚乙丙乙庚同为角形内之两角乃俱不小于直角〈一卷十七〉何也则甲丙乙不得不等于丁己戊也而其馀乙与戊角等矣〈一卷卅二〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"后续讨论：乙 和 戊 不小于直角的原因如前述讨论所述。根据之前的论证，角 乙 和 丙庚乙 相等，这意味着 丙庚乙 也不小于直角。由于 丙庚乙丙乙庚 也是一个三角形，因此两个角都不小于直角 〈一卷十七〉。为什么？那么 甲丙乙 必须等于 丁己戊，其他角 乙 和 戊 也相等。〈一卷卅二〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-7.source","contentId":"euclid-6-7","revisionId":"euclid-6-7@raw-75e6480ae2f3c2d8","order":25,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"414d7508b7f19828bd4396761a5823601e34b564af141efae77a380e13a83d34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-7:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-7.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-7:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-7.proof.2","euclid-6-7.proof.10","euclid-6-7.proof.17"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://